{"name":"The Transform Sign","slug":"glyph-transform-sign","blurb":"On the transform street, Sol carries the sign toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Transform. Click the sign and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Transform Sign.","seal":"1bef1e80f95dbcc7860c1cbca07e1ac72f36c14d9606c398ebb1a35e4907effd"}
